In Latex file with 12pt article style and gregorio.tex use \grechangenextscorelinedim{9}{spaceabovelines}{1cm plus 0.36461cm minus 0.09114cm}{scalable}
\grechangenextscorelinedim{14}{abovelinestextraise}{0.3cm}{scalable} a to deal with the invitatory antiphon instruction on the 9th line. Do the same for other lines as required for your page width/line breaks.
Requires LaTeX compiling twice to get correct appearance.; Originally typeset using default options in 12pt article style, US letter.

Originally typeset article style, 12pt, US letter, default margins. To fix abovelines text used as invitatory instruction using gregoriotex, add lines \grechangenextscorelinedim{3}{spaceabovelines}{1cm plus 0.36461cm minus 0.09114cm}{scalable}
\grechangenextscorelinedim{3}{abovelinestextraise}{0.3cm}{scalable}
to latex file before loading the score.

